  "notes": [
    "Direct runtime has no executable storage-write, delegatecall or selfdestruct path; its constants and constructor-initialized state cannot change. Funding and pool reserve changes alter exposure or supply attack inputs, rather than install the defective spot-price accounting.",
    "Gross excess migration inventory, after deducting 48.140333737643359359 CELL of ordinary old-LP replacement from the measured 963002.994732800177571756 CELL depletion. The USD amount values that excess at the weighted average realised disposal unit value: 377.447033146283009488 WBNB / 914482.663392996590260795 gross CELL disposed, times historical BNB $306.55. The quantity is exact under the documented pre-manipulation replacement baseline; USD is a medium-confidence valuation, not exact cash proceeds. Liquidity-withdrawal burns and inventory used for loan/fee shortfall receive the same unit valuation; financing costs do not reduce gross loss. Attacker-supplied borrowed CELL and WBNB, recycled LP collateral and the 0.1-BNB preparation input are excluded from inventory quantity. The subsequent owner rescue concerns remaining inventory and does not recover the stolen excess.",
    "USD values gross excess inventory at the weighted realised disposal unit value; tokens burned or used for financing shortfall are valued at the same rate, so it is a medium-confidence valuation rather than exact cash proceeds."
